visualEditorJS: compose shared editor helpers, toolbar builder and view designer.
visualArguments: edit ordered typed values, resolve retained results, report invalid values, add/remove arguments and notify the owner of changes.
visualMethodChoices: read receiver relationships and offer sorted selectors.
visualValidateView: validate supported controls, children/argument arrays, table column keys, required action selectors, slider bounds and nesting depth; preserve unknown fields.

Include live-control editor helpers. Accept Wiring-backed actions without a message selector.
